<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Elite Q2 net down.</title>
<headline>Israel's Elite Q2 net down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elite Industries Ltd, Israel's largest publicly traded food manufacturer.</p>
<p>			 (In thousands of shekels )</p>
<p>			 Q2 96	 Q2 95	6-MTH 96    6-MTH 95</p>
<p>Sales		  443,403     585,784    1,009,068   1,258,652</p>
<p>Operating profit    11,016	15,537	 42,805	49,318</p>
<p>Net profit	     6,147	10,645	 22,282	29,976</p>
<p>($1 = 3.20 shekels on June 30)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
